ins.com/","releaseNotes":"Stability and performance improvements, pin tasks, and improved subagents support\n- Pin tasks in a dedicated Pinned section\n- Invoke built-in and custom Codex subagents, and custom Junie subagents, from the / menu\n- Model search now filters the list to matching models\n- Faster Claude startup and Git checkpoints in large worktrees reduce the wait before agent requests\n- Fixed startup freezes, memory-related crashes in long sessions, cloud task loading failures, and chat freezes with custom ACP agents\nShare your feedback with us via the issue tracker or contact form.","releaseNotesUrl":"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issues?q=%23AIR%20%23Resolved%20Fix%20Version:%20262.1037%20","tags":["agent","agentic","ai","chatbot","code","coding","large-language-model","llm","programming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"用于与编码智能体多任务协作的智能开发环境。","license":"免费软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Air 是 JetBrains 推出的智能开发环境（Agentic Development Environment）。它让你可以跨多个编码智能体和项目并行处理任务，在将工作委派给 AI 智能体的同时保持对代码审查的掌控，并继续使用你所熟悉的 JetBrains 工具。这是 Air 的公开预览版本。","publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/zh-cn/","tags":["人工智能","代码","大模型","大语言模型","智能体","编程","聊天机器人","自主智能"]}},"publisherSupportUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/support/","publisherUrl":"https://www.jetbrains.com/","releaseDate":"2026-11-10","releaseDateSource":"commit","releaseNotesUrl":"https://youtrack.jetbrains.com/issues?q=%23AIR%20%23Resolved%20Fix%20Version:%20262.1037%20","schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","upstream":{"commit":"411ee5b30152224ab652f0629684a360adabd366","manifestVersion":"1.12.0","manifests":[{"path":"manifests/j/JetBrains/Air/Preview/262.1037.14/JetBrains.Air.Preview.installer.yaml","sha256":"936fa9f8762c16613b996e409c6459f5d33ec23b37b4504e25b20f0f879b436e"},{"path":"manifests/j/JetBrains/Air/Preview/262.1037.14/JetBrains.Air.Preview.locale.en-US.yaml","sha256":"3e3186deb122d4cf1a175e8452d2396409bac533b568dc6956f9814bb225873a"